      "message": "\"if (!is_enabled)\" is already checked before usb_wait_console().\nPlease see line 340 and line 372 in base.\n\nI think either tx_fifo_is_ready() is true or false, usb_wait_console() should not return at all. It should run the next codes so that it can wait until tx_q has enough space. Otherwise, the caller - in base code  might attempt to put more characters into tx_q though tx_q doesn\u0027t have space if \"tx_fifo_is_ready()\" is true.",
